{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: Since we last spoke, I made a meditation guide for my yoga retreat. How about you?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-48/session_17-d4c80ff11594a98cdcd61a1a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:50:45.993062+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d4c80ff11594a98cdcd61a1a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d4c80ff11594a98cdcd61a1a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: I have been stressed since I lost my work files. I was so overwhelmed...but meditation kept me chill and I got my clarity back, thank goodness. Really appreciate the practice!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-48/session_17-38bb25f90a0c6e1aafcc60a4", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:50:46.015150+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "38bb25f90a0c6e1aafcc60a4", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "38bb25f90a0c6e1aafcc60a4", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: It's amazing how it can give you peace and calm in times like that. If you ever need any support, just let me know - we're in this together!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-48/session_17-a42cdf2f3f12de7d121d7080", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:50:46.036773+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a42cdf2f3f12de7d121d7080", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a42cdf2f3f12de7d121d7080", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: Appreciate your support! BTW, I wanted to share this with you."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-48/session_17-9086a4a089791d02c3f634f4", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:50:46.056093+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9086a4a089791d02c3f634f4", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9086a4a089791d02c3f634f4", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: Your creativity is amazing!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-48/session_17-434ce134f477d2933d134909", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:50:46.073406+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "434ce134f477d2933d134909", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "434ce134f477d2933d134909", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: Thanks, Deb! I was inspired by my love for space and engines, so I designed these notebooks with elements like galaxies and circuitry. I think they turned out really cool!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-48/session_17-4c6b2c654ad37c3911704b63", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:50:46.089094+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4c6b2c654ad37c3911704b63", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4c6b2c654ad37c3911704b63", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: You have such a knack for turning these into art. They make me feel excited just by looking at them. Your creativity is amazing! Does that usually inspire your engineering projects too?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-48/session_17-7d9475fac3b8a63b399ac8a7", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:50:46.111083+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7d9475fac3b8a63b399ac8a7", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7d9475fac3b8a63b399ac8a7", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: Seeing art and design in various things gives me a unique perspective on problems."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-48/session_17-f174a7e2d3c9a2956ec387e8", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:50:46.129007+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f174a7e2d3c9a2956ec387e8", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f174a7e2d3c9a2956ec387e8", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: Got any neat projects or ideas you're pumped about?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-48/session_17-94995f22b8c64956936404ae", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:50:46.143854+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "94995f22b8c64956936404ae", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "94995f22b8c64956936404ae", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: Working on a cool project now - a prototype that could revolutionize aerial surveillance. Can't wait to see the results!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-48/session_17-8982d573be5379a6e31246e1", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:50:46.158193+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "8982d573be5379a6e31246e1", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "8982d573be5379a6e31246e1", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: I admire your ambition to make a difference. Do you have any specific plans or goals for this project?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-48/session_17-abb20b6db4cfd022d138669f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:50:46.174347+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "abb20b6db4cfd022d138669f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "abb20b6db4cfd022d138669f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: My aim is to devise a more productive and affordable aerial surveillance system. It'll help with responding to emergencies and monitoring the environment. It'll make the world a better, safer place."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-48/session_17-01ea9d1e835a9f1a7e1b42b2", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:50:46.188659+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "01ea9d1e835a9f1a7e1b42b2", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "01ea9d1e835a9f1a7e1b42b2", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: I love your commitment. Keep going!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-48/session_17-f6872fc2d1cbafe9b1a696af", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:50:46.209837+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f6872fc2d1cbafe9b1a696af", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f6872fc2d1cbafe9b1a696af", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: Thanks, Deb! Your support means a lot. I'll keep pushing and doing my best to make a difference."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-48/session_17-4b2b6e6dd47e54d30c0f9c5b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:50:46.222031+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4b2b6e6dd47e54d30c0f9c5b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4b2b6e6dd47e54d30c0f9c5b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: You got this!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-48/session_17-8a2415d3ce7bfa4a14a0980b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:50:46.238998+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "8a2415d3ce7bfa4a14a0980b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "8a2415d3ce7bfa4a14a0980b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
